abstract: >
A catalog of uncertainty parameters for energy system modelling,
developed as part of doctoral research. The catalog provides a
structured collection of uncertainty parameters to support uncertainty
analysis, sensitivity analysis, and the identification of influential
parameters in energy system models.

keywords:

* uncertainty analysis
* sensitivity analysis
* energy system modelling
* energy systems
* uncertainty parameters
* global sensitivity analysis
* Sobol analysis

